Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我一直好想坐坐看马车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:16.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克 你太兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:19.54,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们是要去帮赛西莉亚的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谁让你擅自跟过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你想丢下我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:32.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶 我本来想和赛西莉亚独处耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:36.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不好意思 让你陪我去处理事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:40.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:44.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我好像晕车了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:46.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,要休息一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:48.08,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那就喝这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:51.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这是皮克西秘传的煎药
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.24,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:02.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,感觉舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:03.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:07.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你看 我帮上忙了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:09.34,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:13.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:15.84,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有你们两个来 我放心多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.22,0:01:20.10,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,也包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:22.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就叫你走开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:25.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:46.25,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,《身为魔族的我 想向勇者小队的可爱女孩告白》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:03.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,听说是遭到强盗的袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是太惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:10.04,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:14.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没想到是赛西莉亚大人来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那两位是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:19.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,他们是我朋友 来帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:23.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请放心 他们的治疗能力很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:23.93,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.43,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是太可靠了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢妳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:42.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请多保重
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:47.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,赛西莉亚真的很认真
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:50.58,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这么努力帮人们治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:54.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,保重喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:55.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:04:00.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,赛西莉亚大人真是了不起的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.59,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就是啊 就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:09.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没有人因此丧命 真是不幸中的大幸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:14.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊 那些强盗突然就逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:15.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,逃走了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:20.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不知道是谁突然打倒了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:22.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,起内讧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:24.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,赛西莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:37.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,赛西莉亚 稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.05,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:43.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,神圣钟声
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:51.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,放心 她只是睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:55.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,有没有可以休息的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:00.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,醒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:12.04,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,知道我想说什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:15.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我突然用魔法让妳睡着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:20.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不可以随意无视他人的意愿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.55,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是没错啦 但妳也不可以勉强自己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:26.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳再继续治疗的话 会累倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:29.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,说得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:32.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但以后请别这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:34.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我答应妳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:37.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们已经治疗完了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:43.48,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:47.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:59.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,赛西莉亚大人 您恢复精神啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:02.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,让村长担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:06.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,很抱歉在您疲累的时候 跟您说这些
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:10.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,离村子较远处 住着一位名叫缇儿的少女
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:13.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,能请您也去看看她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.43,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,她也被强盗袭击了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:19.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不 还好强盗没袭击她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:26.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但是缇儿天生体弱 经常卧病在床 我很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请告诉我们地点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:35.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,请问是哪位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:40.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不好意思 突然打扰妳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我是赛西莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:45.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这位是阳树先生和西克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是村长拜托我们过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:49.27,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,村长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克 交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,喝下这个药吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:07:00.80,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,放心 别看西克这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:03.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,其实他有丰富的治疗知识
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:06.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,队长 这样是哪样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:15.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,感觉身体轻松多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:20.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢你给我这么好的药
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:24.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这一切都是守护神的保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:25.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,守护神?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:30.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是在村外的神像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:31.93,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,神
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,像?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:35.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,强盗来袭的那天也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:38.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我拿供品去供奉神像 回来的途中突然睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:40.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,所以才没被强盗袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:41.94,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,确定不是凑巧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:43.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不止这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:46.44,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我七岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:50.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,在我以为完蛋的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:57.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,守护神救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:04.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这样不是保佑 什么是保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:07.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,很强的睡意和黑色雷电
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.91,0:08:09.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,黑魔法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:12.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生 我觉得有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:13.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,才不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:16.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你们只要看一眼就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不 这是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.97,0:08:19.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不管怎么看都是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:23.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,恶 恶魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我不许你侮辱守护神
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.69,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,缇儿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:34.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不好意思 勉强妳出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.58,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来 这简直就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:47.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,魔王城里的石像鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:54.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,果然就是石像鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:55.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:56.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:03.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,队长 要怎么处理这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:06.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,下手真快
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.98,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,喂 你会说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:09.87,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,要杀要剐 随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:14.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:17.74,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我还有话要问牠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:21.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你不是来杀我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:24.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,先攻击我们的是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:26.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,因为你们知道我的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:31.50,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,又说到魔王城之类的话题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:33.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们才不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不过为什么你这个恶魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:37.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,会变成村子的守护神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:42.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我原本是被制作来守护某个神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:46.19,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但在很久以前 被强盗偷了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,而他们又袭击了村子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:51.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,所以我就降下了天罚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:57.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,至此之后 村民就擅自叫我守护神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:10:00.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不过最近只有 那个小女孩来祭拜我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:02.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,缇儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:08.90,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,自从我帮她击退魔物后 她就每天来打扫这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:11.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,昨天我知道又有强盗来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:13.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就把她藏了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:15.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:19.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那你并不打算害人类啰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:20.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:23.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我只是住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:26.48,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,本就不想跟人类有任何关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.91,0:10:28.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那应该没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:30.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.47,0:10:31.73,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克 过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:33.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,队长 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:35.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,跟你说件事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:45.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克真可爱 说觉得想睡 所以就先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.75,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,他本来就还是个小鬼头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:52.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,其实是我让他回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:54.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这样我们就能单独相处啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.26,0:10:56.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:58.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:00.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:04.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那个恶魔像 放着不管应该也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:08.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然村里有魔物是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:13.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但牠似乎不会给村民们添麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:16.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊 而且还一直很安分守己
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,应该不会有事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.10,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我们就暂时先观望一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:21.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:27.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,糟 糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:30.33,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么办? 没话题了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:39.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,赛西莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:51.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那个 走路小心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:52.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,走夜路很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,强盗来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:16.37,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:19.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,把钱和食物通通都交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:20.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:24.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我不允许你们继续做坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这些小鬼是怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克 上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:30.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好 开始啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:32.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.01,0:12:35.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:39.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好强喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:41.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没白当过我的部下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:44.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 我也得好好战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:45.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我来支援
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.57,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,暴岚一闪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:48.58,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.04,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,再来是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.07,0:12:56.37,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:57.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:59.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,轻轻松松
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:01.92,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:03.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,从守护神的祠堂传来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.09,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克 快过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.59,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:10.35,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,别小看我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:13.37,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,区区两个人 就想打赢我们这么多人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:16.85,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就凭你们 我一个人就足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:18.98,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:20.73,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,狂乱风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:27.49,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:30.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克还没回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好像还没耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:36.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,守护神 您撑着点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:46.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:50.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,名人出现了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:54.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这家伙是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:57.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,他是迦利斯帝国的勇者 米拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:58.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:01.48,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,除了那个勇者之外 还有其他勇者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:05.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我 我还没跟他分出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:08.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,西克 不要逞强
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:09.95,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:15.95,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那家伙趁恶魔像保护缇儿时 从后面发动攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:19.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我本来想保护他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:22.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,她居然袒护恶魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:24.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:26.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:30.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,干嘛? 魔物就该杀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:34.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,住手 牠只是想保护缇儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:37.94,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那我就连那个小鬼一起砍成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:38.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,休想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:44.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,魔法消失了?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 阳树先生快退后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:49.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那个人跟你的属性相克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:53.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,他手上拿的剑 是人造魔剑噬魔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是一种会吞噬魔法的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:59.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就是这样 给我滚一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:02.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,守护神
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:04.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,若是你伤害克拉利涅斯的人民
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:07.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,会引发国与国之间的战争
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:11.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,战争 好啊 我非常欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:18.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,在和平的时代 很难厮杀个痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:20.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,战争时 就能无止尽地杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:23.07,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对吧 大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:27.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,看来 你没有身为勇者该有的尊严
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:31.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不能放任这家伙不管
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:33.86,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,魔法对我没用喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:36.27,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:40.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,嘴上说得好听 实力只有这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这只是跟你打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:54.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我说了 魔法对我没用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:56.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你要不要挥一下武器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.76,0:15:59.77,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 我只会使用魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:01.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:06.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,天真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:09.19,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,徒劳无功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:12.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不妙 一旦小鬼用尽魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:13.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,就会瞬间被打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:14.70,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.95,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那么这招又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:22.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,炽焰电浆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,好可怕的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:34.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么会? 连最高级的魔法都没用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,笨蛋就只会这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:39.97,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我差不多该拿出真本事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,没用啦 没用啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:50.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,以人类来说 你的魔力的确多得惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但当你用尽魔力时 就完蛋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:55.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:01.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,对付我以外的人 或许会有用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:06.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,区区的人造魔剑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:09.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,能吸收的魔力还是有限的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:12.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是你的末路了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:16.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你到底有多少魔力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:24.98,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,暴岚一闪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:34.11,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,谁叫你要惹本大爷发怒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:37.46,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你的傲慢就到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:43.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:46.58,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:53.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,太好了 我保护了守护神
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,缇儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:02.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:05.91,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,人类保护魔族 害自己毙命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:07.73,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是太有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.51,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.51,0:18:11.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我绝不原谅你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:13.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:17.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不保护他们的话 他们都会死光的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:20.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:28.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,逃走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:37.13,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,以为自己有外挂等级的魔力 就以为什么事都能称心如意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:02.26,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:07.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:20.63,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:23.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,来得好 我正觉得不爽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.82,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我狩猎魔兽 何错之有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:27.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:33.15,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,可恶 你是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:36.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,夺走我部下手臂及双翼的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:40.15,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你的所作所为 罪该万死
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:43.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,是那只恶魔像的主人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.96,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,魔王都已经被打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.96,0:20:01.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么还有这么强的魔族
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:02.88,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:05.56,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,去死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:20.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你想对我做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:28.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我懂 杀戮很快乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:32.83,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:38.16,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,你不值得被我杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:44.30,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,运气好的话 应该能回你的国家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:46.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:49.67,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我绝不允许被人这样侮辱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:02.19,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,阳树先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:05.32,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,大家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:09.33,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,大家都没事 都睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:11.81,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这样啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:13.42,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,流血了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这个啊 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:17.71,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这是我自己拔断角时弄得伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:20.22,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎么会没事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:25.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:28.01,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:31.72,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,妳想去密涅瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:33.47,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,求求妳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:37.02,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我想找方法治疗守护神的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:40.66,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,恢复魔法无法治愈牠的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:41.98,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,但密涅瓦里应该有方法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:46.36,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,可是魔物不能进密涅瓦喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:49.12,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,那我有个不错的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:51.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,用土魔法改变他的外型
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.61,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,这样就看不出来是魔物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.37,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,的 的确看不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.87,0:22:02.41,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,既然是赛西莉亚介绍的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.41,0:22:05.31,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,当然可以在这座宅邸里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.31,0:22:06.76,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我很擅长打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:11.14,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我想把这个石像放在宅邸里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:12.17,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:16.21,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,我可不想在房子里 放这么没品的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:17.52,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:20.06,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,怎 怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:24.62,Sousei-CN,,0,0,0,,守护神
